slipcase-desktop (0.1.8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Both store packages say Slipcase is offered in German. The catalogue has
    been complete since 0.1.7 and neither package said so, so the Windows
    listing could not be filed under German and macOS offered nothing in its
    per-app language picker. No change for a Debian user.
  * The macOS property list parses. It carried a double hyphen inside an XML
    comment, which XML forbids.

