slipcase-desktop (0.1.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New container...: make a container out of a file, then fill in its
    metadata in the tree. Until now the only way to make one was the
    slipcase command or a ZIP archiver.
  * A large payload packs with a progress bar and a Stop; stopping leaves
    nothing behind.
  * A file that arrived from elsewhere says so on the container it is packed
    into, and still says so when it comes back out.
  * The two buttons on the opening screen are centred.

